#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build a reviewable WebMCP package for the audited TinyPilot Pro 3.0.2 UI.

The source directory must contain the read-only files captured from the device.
This script never contacts or changes a device. It verifies those inputs against
the audited hashes, copies originals into the pack, and writes patched copies to
the pack's package directory. The generated installer requires an explicit
confirmation token, verifies the target again, and creates its own backup.
"""

